ing to learn.\n\nWhich tradeoff is more severe? For safety, stress handling and weather assessment are critical. Communication is also critical. B's uncooperative may be mitigated? C's communication difficulty could impair crew coordination. Egocentric may also affect decisions.\n\nGiven that C is 100% reliable and creates positive atmosphere, but difficulty communicating ideas could be mitigated with training? However, not willing to further education is a red flag for long-term suitability.\n\nThus I might lean towards Candidate B, but note uncertainty about teamwork. I could ask others about B's teamwork or C's communication specifics. But we have limited.\n\nWe can state provisional preference: Candidate B, with confidence moderate, but note uncertainties about teamwork and communication.\n\nWe should mention that Agent 3 also favored B, Agent 2 didn't provide new info on A/D.\n\nThus produce public message."}
